# Git and commit policy

- **Never** run `git commit`, `git push`, or `git commit --trailer ...`.
- **Never** add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, Copilot, Codex, Claude, or any AI agent.
- When work is ready, give the user exact commands; they commit and push manually.
- CI `commit-policy` rejects PRs with forbidden trailers (see `docs/commit-policy.md`).
